# API guide

The driver's API by task, with code that compiles.

| Group | Calls |
| --- | --- |
| Lifecycle | `Initialize()`, `EnsureInitialized()`, `IsInitialized()`, `Deinitialize()`, `Sleep()` |
| Measurement | `ReadTemperatureC()`, `ReadVoltageMv()` |
| Configuration | `GetConfig()`, `xmpl100::Validate()` |

